;fau'u:((BPFK Section: Vocatives|COI)) 
"Forgive me!" as vocative. (((Experimental cmavo|experimental cmavo)) proposed by guskant. I did not know ''fau'u'' is listed in ((Experimental anaphorics|experimental anaphorics)) when I added ''fau'u'' as COI to [http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/dict/fau'u|jbovlaste]. However, I did not find the anaphoric usage of ''fau'u'', so keep it suggested as COI. ''fau'u ro do'') 
